  dialogueLines:
  - "INTERN1: Hey, hey, you. Mind reviewing lyrics for the next PR musical spot?
    It goes like\u2026"
  - 'INTERN: We treat our employees super nicely / And to buy our products would
    be wisely.'
  - "INTERN: Oh, and there\u2019s the chorus-!"
  - 'INTERN: Happy, well-paid hands build quality precisely / And Bestle SA definitely
    does not benefit from child labor or price-fixing cartels in West Africa contrary
    to what multiple human rights organisations try to prove. '
  - "INTERN: I\u2019m still working on a rhyme to the word \u201Cprove\u201D."
