  dialogueCanvas: {fileID: 1570910845}
  dialogueText: {fileID: 1570910844}
  dialogueLines:
  - "BOSS: \u2026And then, she left me for a vibe coder guys. A vibe coder. She said
    he has a bigger keyboard than me.\r"
  - "BOSS: It\u2019s a good thing we have each other, pals. Real good. It\u2019s
    true what they say: your co-workers are your second family.\r"
  - "BOSS: I should post it on LinkedIn. \u201CWhat did divorce teach me about importance
    of team communication\u201D.\r\r"
  - "BOSS: #FuckYouLisaILoveMyCoworkerBobMoreThanIEverLovedYouAnyway\r\r\r"
